    "title": "Dozens attend Duke SJP 'die-in' memorializing Palestinians killed in Israel-Hamas war - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sarah Diaz ,\n1 days ago Duke Students for Justice in Palestine (SJP) hosted a ‘die-in’ Wednesday evening to memorialize Palestinians killed in the Israel-Hamas war. During the event, titled “Echoes of Gaza,” speakers orated poems, gave speeches and read the names of individuals killed in the conflict. They largely focused their messaging on calling upon Duke to divest from Israel. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 11",
